lor:rgb(34,34,34);margin-bottom:30px;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\">\r\n  <ul style=\"padding-left:0px;margin-left:3px\">\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_9105871930460569805_m_-4981258975782485666_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      Resumo condensado de r-...@googlegroups.com - 1 atualização em 1 tópico</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(119,119,119)\">4 actualizações</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_9105871930460569805_m_-4981258975782485666_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"padding:4px 0px 5px;font-family:arial;display:inline-block\">\r\n  \r\n    <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);font-size:21px;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-pt/t/baecc786ae618af5?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-pt/t/baecc786ae618af5?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793411003808000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3KDunjdViBnAfKwthCqlkm\">\r\n      Resumo condensado de r-...@googlegroups.com - 1 atualização em 1 tópico\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\">\r\n    \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n        &quot;Diana Feijó&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">diana....@gmail.com</a>&gt;: May 09 03:34PM +0100\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      olá!<br>\r\n <br>\r\ntudo bem?<br>\r\nalguém já teve problemas ao carregar o package car? com Rstudio (<br>\r\n <br>\r\nR version 3.2.2) com win7.<br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\ndá-me o seguinte erro:<br>\r\n <br>\r\n require(car)Loading required package: carError in\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-pt/msg/7f0e069dc955f?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-pt/msg/7f0e069dc955f?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793411003808000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3j1yA2vRJ8ej6xbi8lRUIQ\">...mais</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n        Marta Rufino &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marta.m...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: May 09 03:42PM +0100\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Olá Diana,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nExperimenta sem o R-studio... como primeiro passo.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nbjs<br>\r\nM.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nNo dia 9 de maio de 2016 às 15:34, Diana Feijó &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">diana....@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\nescreveu:<br>\r\n <br>\r\n&gt; Para publicar uma mensagem\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-pt/msg/7f1576860a307?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-pt/msg/7f1576860a307?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793411003808000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Zp6l7kzbk8BWEyw8pZ_I0\">...mais</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n        &quot;Patrícia Gonçalves&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gonpatri...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: May 09 03:42PM +0100\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Olá Diana,<br>\r\n <br>\r\ntens que instalar o R versão 3.2.5.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nbeijinhos<br>\r\n <br>\r\n\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-pt/msg/7f159bb1e7766?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-pt/msg/7f159bb1e7766?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793411003808000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tq3Erz1ldjeJ9zKnoXVBA\">...mais</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n        Rui Coelho &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">coelh...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: May 09 05:06PM +0100\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Olá,<br>\r\nComo já disseram, parece ser uma questão de versões.<br>\r\nPodes actualizar o R, ou ir ao repositório do CRAN e descarregar uma versão<br>\r\nda car adequada para a versão do R que estás a usar.\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-pt/msg/7f5ed3eb04264?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-pt/msg/7f5ed3eb04264?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793411003809000&amp;usg=AOvVaw22b8FFWg6RaSPLslGd9hak\">...mais</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>